menu "B2 controller options"

config B2_CELLULAR_PPP_ENABLED
    bool "Enable native esp_modem SIM7600 PPP data mode"
    default n
    help
        Enable the official Espressif esp_modem PPPoS data path. This mode
        takes exclusive ownership of the modem UART and therefore replaces
        the legacy AT/SMS/GNSS service at application startup.

config B2_ETHERNET_ENABLED
    bool "Enable optional native W5500 Ethernet"
    default n
    depends on ETH_USE_SPI_ETHERNET && ETH_SPI_ETHERNET_W5500
    help
        Enable the native ESP-IDF W5500 SPI Ethernet adapter. The board
        profile must provide verified SPI and interrupt/reset pins; this
        option is disabled by default because the carrier PCB is unknown.

config B2_I2C_EXPANDER_ENABLED
    bool "Enable optional PCA9548A I2C bus expander"
    default n
    help
        Enable the native PCA9548A channel-select helper. Existing sensors
        use the unmodified base I2C bus; callers must select and deselect a
        channel explicitly when an expander is installed.

endmenu
